{"id":"dc2ac7dcdb2ca129","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-increasing-tuples.md","title":"Increasing Tuple Codes and Unbounded Number Sets","display":"df-increasing-tuples — Increasing Tuple Codes and Unbounded Number Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-increasing-tuples","aliases":["62-df-increasing-tuples"],"display":"df-increasing-tuples — Increasing Tuple Codes and Unbounded Number Sets","depends_on":["[[62-df-finite-sequence]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition III.7.3","source_pages":[123],"source_pdf_pages":[141]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-increasing-tuples"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-increasing-tuples</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-increasing-tuples — Increasing Tuple Codes and Unbounded Number Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition III.7.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>123</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>141</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>有限序列代码、长度与分量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a>。X 为数集；s、k 为数。IncTuple、Unbd、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^k\">\\([X]^k\\)</span> 和数类型上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[N]^k\">\\([N]^k\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}increasing\\text{-}tuples}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{IncTuple}(s,X,k)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k\\land\\forall j&lt;k\\;(s(j)\\in X\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\;s(i)&lt;s(j)),\\\\\n[X]^k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathsf{IncTuple}(s,X,k)\\},\\\\\n[N]^k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k\\land\\forall i,j&lt;k\\;(i&lt;j\\to s(i)&lt;s(j))\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unbd}(X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall b\\exists n\\;(n&gt;b\\land n\\in X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}increasing\\text{-}tuples}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{IncTuple}(s,X,k)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k\\land\\forall j&lt;k\\;(s(j)\\in X\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\;s(i)&lt;s(j)),\\\\\n[X]^k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathsf{IncTuple}(s,X,k)\\},\\\\\n[N]^k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k\\land\\forall i,j&lt;k\\;(i&lt;j\\to s(i)&lt;s(j))\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unbd}(X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall b\\exists n\\;(n&gt;b\\land n\\in X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用严格递增序列而非任意排列的元组，也不形成自然数有限子集的幂集。原子数码由现有有限序列约定给出；相应类由 Δ⁰₁ 理解形成。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^0\">\\([X]^0\\)</span> 恰含空序列代码 0，即使 X 为空；Unbd 要求数码无界。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition III.7.3；纸面页 123；PDF 页 141。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限序列代码、长度与分量见 [[62-df-finite-sequence]]。X 为数集；s、k 为数。IncTuple、Unbd、$[X]^k$ 和数类型上的 $[N]^k$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"[X]^k","display":false},{"tex":"[N]^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}increasing\\text{-}tuples}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{IncTuple}(s,X,k)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k\\land\\forall j<k\\;(s(j)\\in X\\land\\forall i<j\\;s(i)<s(j)),\\\\\n[X]^k&\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathsf{IncTuple}(s,X,k)\\},\\\\\n[N]^k&\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k\\land\\forall i,j<k\\;(i<j\\to s(i)<s(j))\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unbd}(X)&\\leftrightarrow\\forall b\\exists n\\;(n>b\\land n\\in X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[X]^0","display":false}],"bytes":1496,"backlinks":[{"id":"3aeb2b5e802f90c1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$[X]^k,[N]^k$、Unbd 见 [[62-df-increasing-tuples]]；Fun 与函数应用见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$[0,l)=\\{i:i<l\\}$ 是数初始段。f、H 为数集，k、l、i 为数。Color、Hom、$\\mathrm{RT}^k_l$、$\\mathrm{RT}(k)$、$\\mathrm{RT}_{\\forall}$ 在下式引入，前三者保留所显示的自由数参数。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-increasing-tuples|Increasing Tuple Codes and Unbounded Number Sets]]"}],"outgoing":["b7164631e6f56192"]}